WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
你投了三枚不能退的代币，才发现这个游戏不太好玩。
You spent three non-refundable tokens and found the game uninteresting.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.600
已经付出、现在收不回来的三枚币，是沉没成本。
The three spent and unrecoverable tokens are sunk costs.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:17.000
继续玩，或者现在离开，它们都留在机器里。
They stay in the machine whichever option you choose.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.200
真正会被下一步改变的是后面二十分钟。
What your next choice can change is the next twenty minutes.

00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:28.000
继续玩能得到什么？把时间留给另一件事又能得到什么？
What would continuing give you? What would doing something else give you?

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.200
如果还有一张票能退，退回的金额要算进现在的选择。
If a ticket is refundable, include that refund in today’s decision.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:39.000
违约代价、剩余乐趣和未来学习机会，也仍然相关。
Switching costs, remaining enjoyment, and future learning can still matter.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
把画面停在现在。假如刚到这儿，你会怎么用剩下的时间？
Pause at the present. If you had just arrived, how would you spend the remaining time?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:56.000
选择留下或转身，都用下一步的收获和代价作理由。
Choose to stay or leave based on what the next step costs and offers.
